Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:44.08,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Accepting PRs from
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:44.08,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}strangers is coming to an
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:44.08,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}end”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think I don't know if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:02.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,this is a hot take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:03.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,but I think we're going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:03.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,to get to the point
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:06.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,where people stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.01,0:00:07.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,accepting open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.39,0:00:07.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,contributions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.67,0:00:09.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,which I think is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.77,0:00:11.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,With what I see in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.13,0:00:11.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,account takeovers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:12.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think even if there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:14.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,a reputation system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.31,0:00:14.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,those accounts are just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:15.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,going to get bought and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:17.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,sold on the secondary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:18.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,markets. And then they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.65,0:00:19.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,just become a vector.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:22.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,So I think my hot take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.07,0:00:25.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,is that the open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:26.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,contributions are coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:26.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:27.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it's going to be a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.83,0:00:28.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,way for you to showcase
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:29.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,your code
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.57,0:00:30.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,what you're doing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:32.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,kind of like provide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:33.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,value in that sense and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:34.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,as like a go to market
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:36.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,tool. But the days of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,accepting a PR from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,somebody who just loves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:40.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,your product.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:42.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,might sadly be coming to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:44.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,an end
